  "body": [
    "Playbook's SDK makes it effortless to manage media in your product without building a file manager.",
    "Integrate anywhere",
    "Embed a fully customizable media library with just a few lines of code.",
    "Toggle exactly what you need: galleries, tags, uploads, board structures.",
