    "All Media",
    "Upload and Download",
    "Search and Tags",
    "User Media Library File sharing and collaboration, built right into your product. Custom Front-End UX/UI",
    "File sharing and collaboration, built right into your product.",
    "Custom Front-End UX/UI",
    "How does Playbook SDK & API work? Your development team first gets access to our SDK and API documentation, where they can generate an authentication key for their developer account to get started. The Playbook Media Library SDK includes three key components: File Sync SDK - Sync user or client files seamlessly with Playbook's storage. Front-End UX/UI SDK – Build a white-labeled media library with folders, subfolders, asset views, sharing, and search. Advanced File Manager SDK – Enable bulk editing and access AI-powered editing tools.",
    "Your development team first gets access to our SDK and API documentation, where they can generate an authentication key for their developer account to get started. The Playbook Media Library SDK includes three key components:",
    "File Sync SDK - Sync user or client files seamlessly with Playbook's storage.",
    "Front-End UX/UI SDK – Build a white-labeled media library with folders, subfolders, asset views, sharing, and search.",
    "Advanced File Manager SDK – Enable bulk editing and access AI-powered editing tools.",
    "How much does it cost? Pricing varies based on your project's needs. Contact us to discuss your specific requirements.",
    "Pricing varies based on your project's needs. Contact us to discuss your specific requirements.",
    "What are some common use cases? Our clients use Playbook SDK & API for: Hosting user training material in their product Managing and sharing media kits across multiple touchpoints from a single source Building a custom media library within their product, complete with collaboration and sharing features",
